Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:52.35,0:01:54.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Eneru's been up there for a while.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.18,0:01:56.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He must have taken\Nthe golden bell by now.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.00,0:02:00.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NAMI]\NNo matter hard you stretch your arms,\Nthere's no way you can reach up there.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.83,0:02:03.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NIf he took it, I'm gonna take it back!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.09,0:02:04.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gimme the waver!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.09,0:02:07.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[engine running]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.88,0:02:22.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AMAZON]\NEven Heaven's Gate was blown\Naway in the twinkling of an eye.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.78,0:02:27.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Angel Island.\NIt's completely destroyed.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.12,0:02:28.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But what are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.58,0:02:30.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And where do we go?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.16,0:02:33.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To Cloud End, and then down to the\NBlue Sea like Captain McKinley said!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.85,0:02:35.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's our only choice.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.07,0:02:36.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.45,0:02:38.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are still a lot of people\Nin the White-White Sea
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.06,0:02:39.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who haven't been evacuated yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.60,0:02:41.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER B]\NThe Milky Roads\Nleading there've been destroyed!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.73,0:02:42.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're gone!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.43,0:02:45.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know how we can bring\Nthose ships down without them!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.21,0:02:46.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER C]\NSo you're saying we\Njust leave those people to die?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.06,0:03:01.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDERS yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.42,0:03:04.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're all doomed.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.01,0:03:09.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AMAZON sighs]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.63,0:03:12.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The White-White Sea is lost.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.05,0:03:18.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Skypiea... it's fading away.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.90,0:03:36.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So this is it.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.01,0:03:40.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Splendid!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.13,0:03:41.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At last!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.87,0:03:47.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The grand belfry that was once the pride\Nof the legendary city of Shandora!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.72,0:03:49.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now it's mine!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.81,0:03:53.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A prize befitting a god\Nof my power and glory!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.31,0:03:56.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The fabled bell, the one\Nthat heralded the start
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.31,0:03:58.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of this land's 400-year old conflict.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.71,0:03:59.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.97,0:04:02.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something's falling toward us again!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.30,0:04:04.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [ZORO] Wait, it's...\N– [USOPP] Take cover!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.02,0:04:09.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA]\NA leaf?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.94,0:04:11.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.14,0:04:16.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA]\NHey, look!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.32,0:04:18.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's something written on it.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.45,0:04:19.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.49,0:04:21.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a message! From Nami and Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.78,0:04:23.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.45,0:04:25.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's it say?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.79,0:04:30.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Cut down this beanstalk and make\Nsure it falls toward the west."
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.33,0:04:34.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWhat?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.03,0:04:35.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... What'll
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.05,0:04:55.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NI've accomplished all\Nof my objectives but one.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.39,0:04:56.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So now...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.45,0:05:04.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It's time I destroyed this pathetic land\Nand the Cumuloregalis Clouds it rests on,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.33,0:05:07.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and set off for the Endless Vearth.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.97,0:05:10.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.85,0:05:14.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm actually gonna miss toying\Nwith the Skypieans' lives!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.44,0:05:16.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP whimpers]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.63,0:05:19.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.46,0:05:22.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn him.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.82,0:05:24.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you see that?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.06,0:05:26.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This one's even bigger!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.46,0:05:34.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Maybe we should get out of here wh-while\Nthere's still some place to get!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.26,0:05:40.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.64,0:05:42.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye, Skypiea!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.98,0:05:47.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's even bigger than his last one!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.90,0:05:49.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.36,0:05:51.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that he's got his grubby\Nhands on the golden bell,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.99,0:05:53.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he has no more use for Skypiea!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.50,0:05:55.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't let him get away with this!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.79,0:06:00.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, "we"?\NBut weren't you gonna escape?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.46,0:06:01.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.76,0:06:03.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't leave now with what's at stake.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.84,0:06:06.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Besides, you want to\Nring that golden bell, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.48,0:06:07.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've gotta!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.44,0:06:08.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For Old Timer!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.32,0:06:13.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... with your arm,\Nyou can't drive the waver.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.78,0:06:16.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I left you here,\Nyou'd keep trying to jump up,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.08,0:06:18.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so leave the driving to me\Nand I'll get you up there.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.33,0:06:22.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.00,0:06:27.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You've got to promise that you'll get\Nus out of this mess in one piece, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.84,0:06:29.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.38,0:06:30.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And thanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.92,0:06:37.13,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWe've only got one\Nchance to get this thing right!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.43,0:06:42.35,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I just hope they got my message and\Nunderstand what we're attempting to do.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.43,0:06:45.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me get this straight!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.97,0:06:48.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're gonna jump to the ark\Nfrom the falling beanstalk?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.60,0:06:50.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NYou got any better ideas?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.89,0:06:53.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well that's crazy.\NThey can't be serious.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.15,0:06:55.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fine, then I'll leave it to you\Nto climb up there and stop Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.98,0:06:57.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He won't listen!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.82,0:07:01.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't care how crazy it sounds!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.05,0:07:02.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have no choice!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.09,0:07:03.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've gotta let him do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.55,0:07:04.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER, AISA grunt]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.53,0:07:07.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWh-What the...?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.31,0:07:08.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NLong nose!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.27,0:07:09.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NI got 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.86,0:07:11.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelps]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.32,0:07:15.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we stay here, we're just gonna get\Npushed down to the ruins below! Run!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.64,0:07:17.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get away from the beanstalk!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.76,0:07:20.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.58,0:07:23.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All I need to do is cut the vine\Ndown toward that ship, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.00,0:07:24.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But...!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.39,0:07:26.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThat maniac is about\Nto wipe this land away,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.23,0:07:29.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}and there are only two people who can\Nreach him before he sets that thing off!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.73,0:07:30.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.81,0:07:32.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! Luffy! Ya better get ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.03,0:07:40.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's far too late to change things now.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.37,0:07:46.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The minute you entered the survival\Ngame, your fates were cast in stone.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.54,0:07:48.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anything you do is futile.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.25,0:07:55.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O-Okay, he's gonna be just fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.09,0:07:58.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro buddy, you're the\Nonly one who can do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.47,0:07:59.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's up to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.60,0:08:04.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.22,0:08:07.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NEneru, I am so sick of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.27,0:08:09.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.89,0:08:20.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right! He did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.48,0:08:25.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NZoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.34,0:08:36.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Insolent little worm.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.21,0:08:43.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.17,0:08:45.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He did it and got zapped.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.17,0:08:46.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But he did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.84,0:08:49.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NOh, no. The vine!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.69,0:08:54.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The vine's not falling!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.56,0:08:55.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But he cut it!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.53,0:08:58.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is that thing made out of?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.99,0:09:02.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks like a plant,\Nbut it's solid as a rock!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.37,0:09:03.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NPathetic!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.74,0:09:06.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is what you outsiders\Nget for butting in!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.12,0:09:08.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA]\NWyper, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.91,0:09:10.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NQuiet!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.37,0:09:15.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We Shandorians are the descendents\Nof Kalgara, not that kid in the straw hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.62,0:09:18.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If anyone is to ring that bell,\Nit should rightfully be us!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.67,0:09:20.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him, Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.04,0:09:21.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's too banged-up to stop us!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.46,0:09:23.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Besides, Nami and Luffy\Nare counting on us!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.38,0:09:27.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our only priority right now\Nis knocking that thing down!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.67,0:09:31.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, Zoro's already\Ncut through half of the stem!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.13,0:09:34.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It probably shouldn't take much\Nto cut through the rest of it!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.50,0:09:37.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My awesome Dance of the Exploding\NStars should do the trick!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.09,0:09:44.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After just one little hit, even a gentle\Nbreeze will knock that thing over!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.14,0:09:46.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once again, it's up to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.01,0:09:48.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The last line of defense\Nin our merry band!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.89,0:09:51.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Robin, leave all the\Ndangerous stuff to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.56,0:09:54.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You tend to our fallen comrades!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.28,0:09:56.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NThey look like an oak leaf mochi cake.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.27,0:09:57.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NForward!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.40,0:09:59.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.98,0:10:05.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NAbout that bell...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.94,0:10:08.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Four hundred years ago,\Nan explorer from my world
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.77,0:10:12.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,said he stumbled upon a city of gold.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.65,0:10:14.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,People laughed at him\Nand called him a liar.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.78,0:10:17.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But he has a descendent today\Nwho still believes the stories,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.87,0:10:22.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}and has spent years searching the Blue\NSea for any evidence of this City of Gold.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.05,0:10:32.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If that golden bell can be rung,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.82,0:10:37.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,everyone will know the City of Gold\Nis in the sky and not a myth.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.61,0:10:39.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the reason Luffy's up there.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now do you understand?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.25,0:10:42.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[USOPP]\NExploding Star!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.87,0:10:45.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NNoble, isn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.62,0:10:49.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Trying to vindicate a man he never met?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.33,0:10:50.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's had chances to escape.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.73,0:10:54.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But he's stuck around\Nto see this thing through.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.71,0:10:57.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That guy's nuts!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.59,0:10:59.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[USOPP]\NRolling Exploding Star!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.60,0:11:01.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Usopp Rubber Band of Doom!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.27,0:11:03.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Regular Exploding Star!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.68,0:11:05.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[explosions]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.80,0:11:17.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NWhat... What is the name\Nof this explorer's descendent?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.13,0:11:19.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NMontblanc Cricket. Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.05,0:11:23.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The name of his ancestor who came here.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.60,0:11:28.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please tell me.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.63,0:11:30.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Was it Noland?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.21,0:11:32.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How...?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.59,0:11:34.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.49,0:11:35.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.70,0:11:37.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.08,0:11:38.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.25,0:11:43.08,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NIs this a sign from you?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.08,0:11:45.54,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Or a miracle?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.54,0:11:48.21,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it, Great Warrior Kalgara?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.98,0:11:53.03,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[KALGARA]\NCome, Nola!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.03,0:11:56.90,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We'll ring the bell again today so\Nthe sound reaches the ends of the earth!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.64,0:12:01.56,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's send the sound you love\Nto say hello to our friend Noland!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.56,0:12:03.48,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOUNG SNAKE hissing]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.20,0:12:14.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOUNG SNAKE hissing]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.58,0:12:16.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOUNG SNAKE whines]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.46,0:12:19.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SNAKE growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.47,0:12:28.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.68,0:12:29.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.03,0:12:38.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What just did that?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.82,0:12:43.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guess it doesn't matter, 'cause it\Ncouldn't even budge that beanstalk!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.70,0:12:46.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe one of my triple\Nexplosions will do the trick.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.03,0:12:47.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [WYPER] Move.\N– [USOPP] Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.30,0:13:03.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[WYPER]\NReject!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.94,0:13:12.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck was that?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.85,0:13:13.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.86,0:13:15.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.90,0:13:19.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NThat fool. A reject dial.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.07,0:13:22.91,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NNow fall, Giant Jack! Fall!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.53,0:13:30.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GROUP gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.62,0:13:35.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NGuys! We've got to run away!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.40,0:13:39.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[engine revving]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.22,0:13:42.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is it! Get on, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.94,0:13:44.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gun it! Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.63,0:13:49.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I should mention,\NI've never revved this waver's
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.30,0:13:51.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,jet dial up to maximum power before.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.68,0:13:54.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was a little scared\Nto see how fast it would go.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.60,0:13:58.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess we're gonna find out now if it'll\Nbe too strong for me to control, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.94,0:14:00.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go for it, Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.23,0:14:01.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NOkay!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.40,0:14:02.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI yelps]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.32,0:14:06.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHang on, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.82,0:14:08.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI am!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.77,0:14:14.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDERS chattering]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.77,0:14:16.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER D]\NIt's falling!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.73,0:14:18.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER E]\NHe's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.34,0:14:21.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER F]\NWhat's going on up there?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.21,0:14:22.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, Nami, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.96,0:14:24.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.42,0:14:25.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.76,0:14:29.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we let this place be destroyed, we'll\Nnever get to ring that bell, and Cricket
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.22,0:14:30.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,will never hear it!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.39,0:14:32.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He helped us, so we gotta help him!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.17,0:14:34.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ring that bell and ring it loud!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.83,0:14:38.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jump to Eneru's ship and stop that guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.63,0:14:40.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.80,0:14:43.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everything's up to you\Nguys now, you got it?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.61,0:14:44.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.64,0:14:50.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NMy, my.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.15,0:15:01.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Now why can't you wait for the completion\Nof Raigo like the rest of the insects?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.07,0:15:03.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Their impatience will be their undoing.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.41,0:15:06.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.30,0:15:17.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That you should even\Ntry to reach me now
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.42,0:15:20.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is insolent far beyond\Nthe point of stupidity!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.64,0:15:22.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now pay for your folly!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.94,0:15:24.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Mamaragan!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.82,0:15:35.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That creep!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.78,0:15:38.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's trying to destroy\Nthe base of the beanstalk!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.95,0:15:39.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.99,0:15:41.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NDo something, Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.53,0:15:42.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLike what?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.74,0:15:45.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're going too fast\Nand we're too high up!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.83,0:15:49.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If this thing loses its foundation,\Nit'll crash before we get to the top!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.96,0:15:52.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We won't reach Eneru,\Nand we'll fall to our deaths!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.85,0:15:56.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Upper Yard's being pummeled!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.31,0:15:57.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.01,0:16:10.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lightning may not harm you, but your\Nabilities are absolutely useless
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.68,0:16:12.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if you can't reach Maxim!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.55,0:16:15.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now fall and face destruction\Nwith the rest of Skypiea!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.85,0:16:19.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye, boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.19,0:16:21.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.01,0:16:31.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN A]\NUpper Yard is crumbling.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.10,0:16:37.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.66,0:16:43.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYou know...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.25,0:16:46.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think he's trying to make sure\Nyou don't get near him again!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.46,0:16:48.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Too bad! He's mine!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.09,0:16:54.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's destroying the cloud\Ncover over the ruins!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.01,0:17:00.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He plans to destroy the ground itself!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.88,0:17:04.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA]\NBut Wyper's lying\Non the ground down there!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.73,0:17:08.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NSo is Zoro! That bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.55,0:17:15.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ruins...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.29,0:17:20.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NIt won't
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.89,0:17:26.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This city will never fall to you.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.78,0:17:29.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA gasps]\NWyper!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.50,0:17:33.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NThis land of Shandora was home\Nto a proud race of warriors.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.56,0:17:43.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This ancient city preserves\Nand protects their memory.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.69,0:17:47.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's more, their memory\Nprotects this city.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.03,0:17:49.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That mighty power\Nwill never fall to you.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.57,0:17:53.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter how much forest you burn.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.48,0:18:05.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,won't fall!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.21,0:18:17.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA yells]\NNo! Wyper!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.66,0:18:20.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [ROBIN] It's too dangerous!\N– Ah! Let me go! Wyper!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.58,0:18:22.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.21,0:18:23.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.67,0:18:26.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can still hear the little\Nfools whining down below.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.34,0:18:28.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.13,0:19:07.71,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NThe Vearth. Of course!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.35,0:19:17.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANDORAN A]\NIt didn't fall!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.93,0:19:20.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Upper Yard is still standing!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.09,0:19:27.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Its power is unbelievable!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.55,0:19:34.32,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NIt must be.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.32,0:19:36.61,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,The Vearth is so powerful.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.60,0:19:42.58,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,What fools we've been!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.58,0:19:45.61,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,It was never something\Nto be fought over!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.61,0:19:48.16,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,We've spilled so much blood.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.94,0:19:51.83,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,And lost so many countless lives.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.83,0:19:56.50,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,How could we be so blind for 400 years?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.34,0:19:59.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA]\NWyper!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.43,0:20:06.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.68,0:20:10.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]\NGet outta there!\NThe beanstalk's coming down!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.27,0:20:12.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, this way,\Nlet's move it! Move it!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.18,0:20:14.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.09,0:20:16.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.01,0:20:22.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER grunts]\NGo! Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.60,0:20:29.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHere I come, Eneru!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.19,0:20:34.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those fools never learn.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.57,0:20:36.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NGive back the Golden Bell!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.86,0:20:39.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.87,0:20:42.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NThat's enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.37,0:20:44.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.75,0:20:50.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now disappear along with this land!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.54,0:20:53.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY growling]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.86,0:20:55.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Raigo!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.97,0:21:07.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[engine running]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.83,0:21:15.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.67,0:21:19.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It won't be for nothing!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.34,0:21:21.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY, NAMI yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.59,0:21:23.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLuffy! Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.51,0:21:26.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ark's over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.35,0:21:28.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.18,0:21:33.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! Don't do it, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.56,0:21:39.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NAMI]\NThe air currents and lightning\Ndischarges in there could kill even you!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.28,0:21:43.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NWhat do you think you can do\Nagainst this kind of power?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.45,0:21:44.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Man of rubber!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.53,0:21:46.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.86,0:22:41.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYou with your thunder and lightning!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.36,0:22:43.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We made it all the way to sky island,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.44,0:22:46.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and you had to come along\Nand ruin the weather!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.14,0:22:49.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You electrical freak!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.91,0:22:54.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, what's with all the\Ncrazy lightning bolts?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.92,0:22:58.58,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NI forgot!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.58,0:23:01.88,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,That gold ball stuck on his\Narm is a natural conductor!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.47,0:23:06.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well then.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.02,0:23:08.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll just drop it before you\Ncan discharge the electricity!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.48,0:23:14.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NLet everything be destroyed!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.46,0:23:18.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WHITE BERET A]\NCaptain McKinley!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.13,0:23:20.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.42,0:23:21.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is God's land!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.85,0:23:23.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is pointless!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.06,0:23:25.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NI don't care if it's pointless.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.06,0:23:29.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the only thing people can do when\Nthey're caught between life and death.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.10,0:23:30.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.80,0:23:34.85,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,We've abandoned our home\Nand chosen to live.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.85,0:23:36.39,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't go back.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.39,0:23:37.89,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Nor can we go forward.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.43,0:23:41.64,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Praying.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.64,0:23:42.85,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Is all that we can do.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.48,0:23:47.86,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NThe song of the island.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:48.65,0:23:53.61,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,When our ears hear that again,\Nthe war will have ended.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.87,0:23:59.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NI wonder...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.92,0:24:01.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are we all doomed?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.54,0:24:07.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe, if I'd had the courage\Nto stand up to Eneru...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.75,0:24:10.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...our friends would have\Nbeen spared all this.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.26,0:24:13.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, Suu...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.81,0:24:14.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SUU]\NSuu?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.81,0:24:17.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does God exist?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.19,0:24:19.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If He does...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.81,0:24:22.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...why doesn't he save us?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.77,0:24:24.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SUU]\NSuu.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.24,0:24:28.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS crying]\NPlease. If You do exist...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.10,0:24:33.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...You must protect those\Nbrave people and keep them safe!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.41,0:24:35.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please! Give us a miracle!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.28,0:24:39.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Protect this land, Lord God!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.49,0:25:14.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That mass of thunderclouds\Nhas vanished!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:15.39,0:25:16.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN B]\NWhat could've happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.67,0:25:39.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]\NYeah! It's him, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:39.05,0:25:41.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.94,0:25:52.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now ring it, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.32,0:25:55.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Light the fire of Shandora!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.78,0:25:57.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go, Luffy! Go, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.40,0:25:59.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NLet me hear it, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:59.25,0:26:00.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The song of the island!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.48,0:26:06.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You destroyed my Raigo!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.91,0:26:07.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're next!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.40,0:26:11.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll ring you along with the bell!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.78,0:26:13.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NImpudent fool!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.49,0:26:21.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ENERU]\NTwo hundred million volt...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.40,0:26:28.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:29.22,0:26:30.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NRing the bell?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.60,0:26:33.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that what you said?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.02,0:26:34.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must be one of\Nthose fools who believes
Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.98,0:26:37.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in the old legend\Nthat when the bell rings,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.07,0:26:42.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,it will mean the end of the war\Nbetween Skypiea and Shandora!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.15,0:26:44.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am God!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.07,0:26:45.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:47.22,0:26:48.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.26,0:26:51.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care how strong you are.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:51.97,0:26:54.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're still just a Paramecia type!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.39,0:26:59.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You could never match the might of my\NLogia power no matter how hard you try!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:59.35,0:27:01.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter what you might do!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.10,0:27:06.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That won't work on me!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.82,0:27:10.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And quit calling yourself God!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.65,0:27:14.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What kind of god destroys\Neverything and saves nothing?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.41,0:27:15.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fake!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.08,0:27:26.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts, yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:26.65,0:27:28.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,was very agile of you.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.00,0:27:30.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You grabbed it before\Nyou could be impaled.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.04,0:27:31.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:31.42,0:27:33.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:33.50,0:27:35.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But what will you do now?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.17,0:27:36.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have nowhere to run!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:38.21,0:27:40.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The pull of the golden ball on your arm
Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.22,0:27:42.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,will draw you deeper and\Ndeeper onto my trident!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:42.89,0:27:46.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And if you should let go,\Nyou'll fall to your death below!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:46.23,0:27:48.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.56,0:27:51.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I admit I'm impressed\Nyou made it this far.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:51.71,0:27:53.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But this is the end for you, boy.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.53,0:27:56.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And this land. Everything!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:56.40,0:27:58.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can easily create another Raigo!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:58.66,0:28:00.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.99,0:28:06.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NIt's the duty of every\Ncitizen here on the Island.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.92,0:28:08.33,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm so very sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:09.21,0:28:11.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.72,0:28:16.77,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA]\NWill the sky islands\Nreally be destroyed?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:18.48,0:28:20.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:23.15,0:28:26.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you prefer to fall, do you?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:26.36,0:28:28.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:31.53,0:28:32.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.44,0:28:34.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.19,0:28:38.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami. Get out of the way, hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:38.46,0:28:43.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.71,0:28:44.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:45.25,0:28:48.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should never mess\Nwith me, earlobes!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:48.08,0:28:52.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now, Gum-Gum... Rocket!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:55.00,0:28:57.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NGum-Gum...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:58.76,0:29:01.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you going to try\Nthat same old trick again?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:01.80,0:29:04.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll keep trying till the bell rings!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:04.98,0:29:06.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This time I'll skewer you, fool!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:06.69,0:29:10.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\N...Golden Rifle!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:10.56,0:29:12.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:29:13.73,0:29:14.48,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NToo fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:33.12,0:29:37.13,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[KALGARA]\NWhen you finally return, what will\Nyou think when you see we're gone?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:41.30,0:29:42.61,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on a little longer!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:42.61,0:29:44.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll let you know\Nthat we're still here!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:54.98,0:29:56.23,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[KALGARA]\NNoland!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:56.23,0:29:58.86,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Light the Fire of Shandora!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.44,0:30:05.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHIEFTAIN]\NThe war in the sky began 400 years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:05.27,0:30:08.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd\Nlive to see this moment.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:11.57,0:30:14.87,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NYes. The Holy Land...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:19.41,0:30:21.58,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,...will sing once more.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:25.26,0:30:27.93,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Someday, it will.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:40.19,0:30:46.77,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOLAND]\NSix years ago, on the island of Jaya in\Nthe Grand Line, I saw the City of Gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:50.37,0:30:53.54,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold does exist!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.91,0:31:07.13,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Not one person in history has ever disproven,\Nheh, the existence of sky island.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:08.73,0:31:11.57,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a romantic! Just like you!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:11.57,0:31:15.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NLet it ring!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:16.87,0:31:18.20,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pops!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:18.20,0:31:19.70,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Can you hear it?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:20.65,0:31:22.74,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold is here!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.15,0:31:30.10,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,For 400 years,
Dialogue: 50,0:31:30.10,0:31:31.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the City of Gold...
Dialogue: 50,0:31:31.85,0:31:35.56,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[bell rings]
Dialogue: 50,0:31:32.26,0:31:36.30,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,...has been in the sky!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
